,"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5313440","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4679490-1847286114029873","game_id":"steam-4679490","kind":"announcement","title":"New Co-op Cards!","summary":"Hi everyone! We’ve added new cards designed specifically for co-op mode, including cards that help your partner.We’ve also updated the combat levels and enemy lineups for co-op. They’re now much more varied and interesting. We hope this new version makes playing co-op even more enjoyable.We’d love to hear your feedback on this update!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T18:04:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029873","verified_at":"2026-10-21T18:21:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4679490-1846651706674065","game_id":"steam-4679490","kind":"announcement","title":"Multiplayer is now available in the demo!","summary":"In this update, we've enabled co-op mode. Multiplayer The “Multiplayer” button in the main menu is now active, so you can try playing together with an ally. Play with one of your friends or with any player online.You can talk to your ally in voice chat. What's NewAlchemy Kit artifact. If you have it, a “Use the Alchemy Kit” option appears at camp, letting you brew a random potion.Treasure Hunter's Compass artifact. If you have it, a “Search for treasure” option appears at camp. You can find one ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T11:57:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706674065","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:57:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4679490-1846018067934041","game_id":"steam-4679490","kind":"announcement","title"